ISO-10303-21;
/* Gs191: Two B_SPLINE_SURFACE_WITH_KNOTS ADVANCED_FACEs: R=50 mm (large) and R=1.5 mm (small) cylindrical patches, each subtending 60 deg; correctly parameterized per AP214; both are ADVANCED_FACE.face_geometry; slicers with hard-coded LinearDeflection=0.1 mm produce visibly faceted mesh on the R=1.5 face while the R=50 face remains smooth; OCCT with configurable chord deflection (0.01 mm) meshes both smoothly; BambuStudio 3437 DEF-HH; OCC yields shape(1) shell with 2 faces */
